{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>正就 47 人案服刑的前香港眾志秘書長黃之鋒，被指 2020 年與羅冠聰等串謀請求外國制裁，被控一項串謀勾結外國勢力罪，今（2 日）將於高等法院處理答辯及判刑，由法官譚耀豪審理。司法機構公布將設 211 個公席眾，當中正庭佔 29 席。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC07521-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>昨晚近十時，現場已有近 40 人排隊，排頭七位的是一直有旁聽黃之鋒案件的旁聽師；其餘為疑似排隊黨。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC07545-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC07662-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC07637-1024x683.jpeg\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T02:03:58.403732+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":4,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}